flowchart TD
    A([Start])
    --> B[Administrator chooses Create Role]
    --> C[Enter name and description]
    --> D[Select Permissions]
    --> E{Role name unique?}

    E -- No --> F[Show duplicate name error]
    F --> C

    E -- Yes --> G{Permission dependencies valid?}

    G -- No --> H[Explain dependency violation]
    H --> D

    G -- Yes --> I[Create Custom Role]
    --> J[Record audit]
    --> K([Role created])
